# GBNF schema for Context Compaction Skill
# This defines the grammar structure for the context compaction skill

# Token types
WORD
NUMBER
PUNCTUATION
NEWLINE

# Grammar rules
CONTEXT = Paragraphs END

Paragraphs = Paragraph (NEWLINE Paragraph)* END

Paragraph = Text (NEWLINE Paragraph)* END

Text = [^ \n]* END

END = \n

# The grammar is designed to match the structured output
# It represents the compaction process where:
# - Raw context is parsed
# - Key entities are extracted
# - Output is generated in structured format

# This schema defines the expected input format and output structure